
STRENGTHS:

Clear and intuitive reporting dashboard
Easy access to learner performance metrics
Easy identification of at-risk  learners
Automated report generation saves time
Tracks attendance, assessments, and competency completion in one place
Enables comparison of individual and group performance

WEAKNESS:

Current reports are designed for clinical use, not education.
• Limited instructor dashboards.
• No competency-based reporting.
• Limited report customization.

OPPURTUNITIES:

Development of education focused Reporting and Analytics
Enhanced competency based learning and assessment
Improved Instructor oversight and Student support
Expansion of EMR training through scalable digital learning


THREATS:

Student privacy and data security concerns.
• Technical limitations of OSCAR.
• Resistance to change from users.
• Time and budget constraints.
